.TH START-CONTROLROOM.SH 1 "2026-10-06" "mu2edaq-controlroom-setup 1.0.0" "Mu2e DAQ Manual"
.SH NAME
start\-controlroom.sh \- start every configured VNC session and open every tunnel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/start\-controlroom.sh
.SH DESCRIPTION
Client\-side wrapper: exits 1 if
.I venv/bin/crs\-remote
is missing, then runs
.B "crs\-remote start \-\-all"
followed by
.BR "crs\-tunnel open \-\-all" .
Its comment says "all six"; it acts on whatever
.I config/controlroom.yaml
defines (three sessions as shipped).
.SH OPTIONS
None.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 on success; otherwise the first failing command's status
.RB ( "set \-e" ).
.SH EXAMPLES
.EX
bin/start\-controlroom.sh && venv/bin/crs\-tunnel connect \-\-session shift\-main
.EE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR stop\-controlroom.sh (1),
.BR crs\-remote (1),
.BR crs\-tunnel (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Mu2e DAQ group.
